{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Third victim of the same missing-.git mechanism, same live server:\n\n    review_code {\"base\": \"HEAD~1\", \"head\": \"HEAD\"}\n      -> {\"error\": \"llm_unavailable\",\n          \"message\": \"git diff HEAD~1...HEAD failed: warning: Not a git repository.\n           Use --no-index to compare two paths outside a working tree ...\"}\n\nConfirmed blast radius on the deployed server, all from /app having no git object DB:\n  - review_plan       (default attested source) - fails\n  - verify_completion (default attested source) - fails\n  - review_code                                  - fails\n  - reconcile         (dry-run, documented non-mutating/always-available) - fails\n  - attach_commits                               - cannot resolve any SHA\nOnly source=local variants run, and a local verdict is never signed."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787815738422559670,"uuid":"054134ef-7e3a-4846-bda9-7ca046e0cf66"}